{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_bobb_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_bobb_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"誰與同行","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bobb_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"dbdcb9be86fabbd009a8dad4f96e930014fd0a18af70c15057936426e3146072","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為感染了礦石病的舊友奔走求助時，埃利西奧意識到：靠一個人的力量，或許能救一個人；想要改善感染者的處境，他還需要同行者。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"narration","text":"面試官小姐，您問我為什麼會選擇貴公司，請容許我與您分享我在街區做社工時，偶爾遇見舊友的一段經歷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一位，請把體檢報告放在這裡。您的姓名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"侷促的病人","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……尤里歐·布蘭科·安東尼奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐？是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，埃利西奧，你還記得我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼呢，中學時代能說上話的朋友本來就沒幾個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那件事後就聯絡不上你了，我還一直擔心。你後來去了哪裡，現在怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵呵，你說的是，我們被那幫小子堵在學校廁所，然後我把其中一個的鼻子打歪的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來為了一根活該斷掉的鼻梁骨，學校要開除我，你堅持申訴，甚至找了校長，最後他們居然真的把開除降級到了普通處分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你還是選擇了離校……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我，埃利西奧。我當時認定，我們這些難民的後裔在學校裡只有被欺負的份，沒有必要死皮賴臉地看他們臉色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……我多傻啊。在學校裡，我們至少還能用成績和他們比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐……你現在還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……埃利西奧，老實說，當我們被那些人堵在廁所的時候，你不肯動手，非要和他們講道理，我在心裡是看不起你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在知道你為我做了什麼以後，我開始佩服你。你看現在，你能在社區裡幫忙，而我依舊是那個拖後腿的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我注意到他手裡拿著體檢報告。當然，他一進來我就注意到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的病況……已經這麼嚴重了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡，最嚴重的疾病是貧窮，比礦石病要可怕，老朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我在上面蓋個章吧，我聽說賠付的時候要用。你們是保險公司的合作機構，他們承認你們的體檢結果，對嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的體檢報告……有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少見到第一次來，病況就如此嚴重的病人。除非是一些消極治療或者……很晚才確診的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你上一次體檢是什麼時候？在哪裡做的？能讓我看看報告嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶了……前幾次是在家附近的社區機構體檢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……你的藥有按時服用嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這你可不能亂說！我向你保證，該吃的藥我一次都沒少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，不同人吃藥的效果也不同，不、不是嗎？如果有包治包好的特效藥，這世上早就沒有礦石病了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用看這麼仔細吧？體檢報告而已，沒有問題就幫我蓋個章吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你這個季度的體細胞與源石融合率提升了接近1%，才一個季度，再這樣下去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果基礎藥物對你不起作用，其實你需要考慮進一步的治療方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有用的建議，我會考慮的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐……是錢的問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不然呢？支付一份基礎保費已經是我家的極限了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜蒂懷孕了。是的，我結婚了，埃利西奧。還沒得病的時候，我覺得認識她是我在這見鬼的國家裡唯一遇到的好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，我成了這個家的累贅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很遺憾……尤里歐。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我說，我很遺憾。那一刻，我確實相信這是無可奈何的事。來這裡的許多病人病情一步步惡化，最終都是這樣的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奧，如果你真的想幫忙的話……你這裡有沒有沒人要的藥？我是指，多餘的，保險公司給你們的樣品，或者過期藥之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能順手給我一兩盒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，這我辦不到。我們每一份藥物的領取都是需要登記的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……埃利西奧，我們以前關係那麼好的時候，我都沒有求過你任何事吧？我、我對那幫哥倫比亞小子都沒低過頭，我最討厭求人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起，尤里歐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧！別放心上，跟你開玩笑的。我領了分內的藥就會離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐，請填一下這張表格吧。我們每個月都會嘗試在社區裡募集資金，幫助經濟困難的病人得到免費治療……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人得到過你說的那種幫助嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。儘管……很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸運不會平白無故降臨到我們這種人身上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"填上吧，尤里歐。我去取你這個季度的藥，請稍等。"},{"type":"narration","text":"儲物室門是玻璃的，刷識別證開門的時候，我從玻璃的反光中，看到他伸著脖子看我。\n我感到愧疚，或許他還心存希望，我能找到那麼一盒多餘的藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐……你的藥。體檢報告上的章我也已經蓋好了。你的事我會想想辦法的，一定會盡力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，謝謝你，埃利西奧。謝謝……再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"一開始，我並未懷疑這場老同學的相逢有什麼深意。直到第二天早上，我的同事慌慌張張地來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十五、四十六……真的少了一盒藥。昨天下班前我清點過，數目是正確的。米克，是你提出的再清點一遍藥物，發生什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心的社工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"才少了一盒？其實……我懷疑我們辦公室遭小偷了。昨天，我的識別證失蹤了，今天早上我在走廊上發現了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心的社工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"……別這樣看著我，我知道你提醒過很多次……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把識別證隨意放在桌上，進出辦事的居民都會經過。等到丟了東西，就不得不懷疑是他們所為。這對雙方都不負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心的社工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，好了，你教訓的是。那麼，你最近有接待什麼可疑的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心的社工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，會不會真的有人來辦事的時候偷了識別證，偷了一盒藥，然後丟下識別證跑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心的社工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣想好像又有點說不通，小偷為什麼只拿一盒？難道還有其他的解釋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不要毫無根據地懷疑任何人了，保管好識別證吧。遺失的藥，我來想辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"narration","text":"那天下班後，我提著一些日用品，拜訪了尤里歐家。\n我知道我沒有證據就不該懷疑他，但他的突然出現，他的病況，還有他的狀態都使我無法釋懷。\n看到站在門外的是我時，他臉上流露出的神情確實並非歡迎。我想我在他的臉上看見了……敵意，還有一絲害怕。\n他只肯把門開一小條縫，還用自己的身體擋著那條縫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（壓低聲音）埃利西奧……？你怎麼會……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的登記資料裡寫了你的地址。原諒我冒昧前來，我有點放心不下，你和你的夫人還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（壓低聲音）是的……是的，你看到了，我很好。或許我昨天不該來找你搭話……總之，不用為我們操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（壓低聲音）家裡很亂，也沒什麼像樣的吃的，連咖啡渣都泡了好多遍了，就不請你進來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，請允許我探望你的夫人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（壓低聲音）她剛剛查出懷孕，醫生說她需要好好靜養。你走吧，埃利西奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屋內的女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，我聽到了耳熟的名字，是你那位老同學來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，你怎麼還下床亂跑？！埃利西奧他……正要離開，我去送送他。不，你不用過來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，埃利西奧，我是娜蒂。我經常聽尤里歐說起你，感謝你對我們家的幫助。進來喝杯咖啡吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就太感謝了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，倒水的事讓我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才是更應該休息的那個，我還沒有虛弱到這個程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請讓我自己來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"經過一番“爭執”，娜蒂還是拿出了家裡僅剩的咖啡，而他們面前的杯子裡只有水。這讓我難以下嚥，但更不想浪費他們的好意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐總是惦記著你的好，每當在外頭有了不愉快，他總會懷念中學那時候呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，他是個會把自己豁出去的人，我也受了他不少照顧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，把自己豁出去……說起這個，我必須要當面感謝你幫了我們家，昨天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！昨天，我向埃利西奧提起了我們將有孩子的事，所以他特地來探望我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，不要打斷我。這麼重要的事，我們應該正式一些表達感謝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藥，你給我們的那盒藥。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我注意到尤里歐絕望的神情，他祈求地望著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……小事，不用介意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道什麼是客氣話。一盒藥對你來說也不會是小事，但確實，我們很需要它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子還有半年才能出生，我們夫妻都希望孩子能見上父親一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐如果積極治療的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……時間不早了，埃利西奧，我送你到車站吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫，一盒藥很重要，因為你必須再活半年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饒了我吧，埃利西奧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底發生了什麼事，尤里歐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掩面痛哭）你非要這麼逼我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤里歐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜蒂她……也感染了……我們在同一條生產線上工作，是在同一場事故裡感染的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們研究了保單，以感染者能賺到的錢來說，付完保費後，就幾乎不剩什麼了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的情況更嚴重，何況她懷著孕，也不能太虛弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們討論下來，這是最划算的選擇——只買一份保險，藥她來吃，這樣別人不知道她感染了，她還可以出去找正常的、薪水更高的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……身故金。患者在一年內因礦石病死亡就可以直接獲賠一筆錢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由母親服藥，確保孩子出生，而自己爭取在一年內死亡，好為他們留一筆治病生活的費用，這就是你們的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是……再這樣下去，我可能撐不過半年。所以，當我聽說你正好在附近的社區工作的時候，我動了來找你的念頭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"病情惡化速度那麼快，別人可能不願意核章。而且，我也在想，如果你能幫我弄到一盒藥，或許我就可以多撐一陣子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不想害了你，所以我偷了別人的識別證……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把什麼都告訴你了，天哪，我真的都說出來了……我做了什麼啊……別去揭發我，好嗎？求你了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"narration","text":"我當時什麼都說不出來。為了新生命的誕生，夫妻兩人決定了由誰死去。我還能說，這本是無可奈何的事嗎？\n我選擇這份工作，正是為了幫助他這樣的人——但說到底，我能做什麼？只是為他補上一份藥？\n在挫敗感中掙扎思考了幾天後，我做了一個決定，徵得了尤里歐的同意後，開始四處為他奔走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"致塔山科技商務部的郵件，未讀。\n致斯科特議員的郵件，已讀，未回覆。\n致記者羅蘭的郵件，已讀，表示十分遺憾，但暗示此類情況並沒有新聞價值。\n致《特里蒙日報》的郵件，已讀，謝絕。\n……\n每一天打開信箱，收到的都是失望。在發出幾十封郵件，奔走十幾家機構後，我終於收到了梅蘭德基金會的回應。\n尤里歐的故事得以在慈善相關的刊物裡佔了車票大小的一塊面積。那之後，事情迎來了轉機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奧先生嗎？您好，我是斯科特先生的助理。斯科特先生讀到了您的文章，十分關心您朋友的病情，想要對他進行資助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好……您是說，那位議員先生？我想，我之前向他寫過求助郵件的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵……斯科特先生的信箱每天都被各種請求佔滿，如果沒有及時回覆，還請諒解。現在我們將向著同一個目標努力，就結果而言是好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（長長舒一口氣）是的，請問，需要我做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不用再做什麼了。這邊希望您提供對方的聯絡方式，剩下的，我們將和那邊直接對接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以瞭解，斯科特先生將怎樣提供幫助嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"綜藝節目。斯科特先生，將在電視綜藝上宣布他的救助計劃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，是尤里歐與娜蒂的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同許多父母輩來自玻利瓦爾的人一樣，尤里歐與妻子住在三十年未經修繕的屋子裡，日日夜夜，重複著薪資低廉的勞動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然而，這一夜卻與平時不同。這一夜，隨著一聲源石鍋爐爆炸的巨響，這對年輕夫婦的命運也被改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（誇張的語調）親愛的，親愛的……天哪，你也感染了。沒關係，我們互相扶持，總能渡過難關的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……親愛的，其實，今天，我本想告訴你一個好消息的……可現在我不知道這個消息是好是壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，懷孕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤里歐","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"尤里歐似乎是忘記了台詞，愣愣地瞪著娜蒂，許久許久，他突然痛哭起來，娜蒂起先勸了幾句，但很快也情緒失控。\n他們的哭泣不像事先的安排，鏡頭及時拉近，對他們哭泣的面容做特寫。這些影像將在精心剪輯後分享給全國的觀眾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯科特議員的辦公室外播放著這期綜藝節目。病人拖著病軀，將自己曾經歷的痛苦在鏡頭前演繹。\n他們不得不將自己的脆弱與無助展現給所有人，以便他們的恩人在觀眾面前“從天而降”，向他們施以援手……\n我不想去評價這一切，他們得到了幫助，我所無法給予的幫助。正因如此，我去到了斯科特議員的辦公室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"您說您是埃利……西奧先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您聯絡過我，我寫了那篇為尤里歐和娜蒂求助的文章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是您。您今天來是為了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我收看了尤里歐的那一期節目，在節目最後，我聽到斯科特先生承諾他將與社區合作，以減輕感染者們的負擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正好負責相關的工作，我是為談合作而來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，這很好……請問您有預約嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"那或許，您需要改日再來。很遺憾，斯科特先生今日的行程已經排滿了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奧先生，您又來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寫了郵件預約見面，可是並沒有得到回覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"如我所言，斯科特先生平時較為忙碌，可能不會閱讀所有的郵件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我寫了一份文件，把我觀察到的感染者們目前遇到的實際困境整理在上面，希望您能幫忙轉交給斯科特先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，我一定照辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請轉告他，我期待著他回覆我的郵件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的，埃利西奧先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奧先生，還是您。這幾個月您每週都來詢問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能為他們做的，也只有“堅持”了，但斯科特先生能做的更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我十分同意，我會提醒斯科特先生閱讀您整理的文件的。今天他並不在辦公室，您還是先請回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我會再來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"議員助理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"……埃利西奧先生，您其實清楚，對嗎？一場秀能為他帶來很多，但如果繼續介入——“那個群體”又能為一位議員帶來什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您的提醒。我想我聽明白了……我不會再來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g2_colombiaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您問我為什麼選擇貴司，以上便是我的說明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤心醫療人事專員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您的分享，埃利西奧先生。然而，您還是沒有回答，您為什麼想來赤心醫療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤心醫療人事專員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，您最後的說明表示，您已經認清了現實，不會再在一位追求名利的議員身上浪費時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赤心醫療人事專員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，為什麼轉向我們呢？因為當時只有我們回應了您的訴求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友因為一場特殊的秀而得到了援助，但是，我所見的感染者的境況並沒有因此而改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全家共用一份藥物的病人；為了隱瞞病情發展而血檢造假的病人；因為經濟壓力和周圍人的目光，選擇結束生命的病人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有辦法為他們每個人準備一場秀，找到一個願意提供資金的援助人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，我無法得知我的提案是否有效。沒有人打開它，便不會有人提出批評或肯定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來這裡，是想尋求合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人兩個人無法改變的事，當更多有著相同目標的人一起努力，結果是否會有不同？我想試一試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
